'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a set of [[medium armor]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

==Acquisition==
Both the [[body armor]] and [[helmet]] can be bought from the [[Python Commandos Premium Warbond|Python Commandos]] page on the [[Superstore|SuperStore]] for {{Currency|Super Credits|300|notext}} and 150 [[Super Credits]], respectively.

